Package: postgresql-PGMAJOR-pg-vault-tde-armce
Architecture: arm64
Depends: postgresql-PGMAJOR-pg-vault-tde (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: pg_vault_tde ARM Crypto Extensions optimized build
 Recompiled with -march=armv8-a+crypto flags for ARM CPUs with
 Cryptographic Extensions hardware support.
 .
 CPU requirement: ARM Cortex-A53+, Apple M1/M2, AWS Graviton 2/3.
